#: src/main.rs
msgid ""
"usage: emuera-tty [GAME_DIR | GIT_URL] [options]\n"
"\n"
"GAME_DIR may be a game folder or an archive of one (.zip, .tar.gz, .7z…;\n"
"extracted once to ~/.local/share/emuera-tty/games).\n"
"GIT_URL (https://…, git@host:…): the launcher clones the game's repository\n"
"into the library (as its \"Clone a game…\" does) and selects it.\n"
"Without GAME_DIR: the current folder if it is a game, else the game\n"
"chosen last time, else a folder picker opens.\n"
"\n"
"options:\n"
"  --choose                         pick a game folder (even if one is remembered)\n"
"  --clone URL                      clone a game's git repository in the launcher (as GIT_URL)\n"
"  --gfx auto|kitty|iterm|sixel|fb|none image backend (default auto)\n"
"  --headless                       plain stdin/stdout mode (scripts, tests)\n"
"  --echo                           echo inputs in headless mode\n"
"  --check                          parse the game and report errors only\n"
"  --strict                         unknown commands are errors\n"
"  --game-debug                    enable [IF_DEBUG] / ;#; lines\n"
"  --vm-debug                      enable interactive debugger (breakpoints, step, watches)\n"
"\n"
"display (each also has an environment variable, which the option overrides):\n"
"  --colors truecolor|256|16        colour depth, when detection guesses wrong (EMUERA_COLORS)\n"
"  --ambiguous wide|narrow|single|osc66\n"
"                                   how box drawing and symbols get Emuera's two columns (EMUERA_AMBIGUOUS)\n"
"\n"
"translation (the languages and the translator are in the F3 settings):\n"
"  --translate-log FILE             append every new translation to FILE (never reset; no row twice)\n"
"  --translate-load FILE            read translations from a translation log, asked before any\n"
"                                   translator (repeat for several; a later file wins)\n"
"  --translate-storage FILE         both of the above, with the one file\n"
"  --translation-filter FILE        script files and lines of text that are never translated\n"
"                                   (repeat for several; # comments; middle-click still translates)\n"
"  --libretranslate HOST:PORT       the LibreTranslate server (default 127.0.0.1:5000; EMUERA_LIBRETRANSLATE)\n"
"\n"
"saves (also in the F3 overlay: Manage saves):\n"
"  --saves                          list the game's saves with their comments\n"
"  --backup-saves                   copy all of them to a new backup folder\n"
"\n"
"retro and serial terminals:\n"
"  --retro[=line]                   drive the terminal from its terminfo entry, ASCII only\n"
"                                   (automatic when $TERM isn't ANSI: vt52, adm3a, dumb…);\n"
"                                   =line prints line by line, for terminals with no cursor control\n"
"  --term NAME                      terminfo name of the terminal (default $TERM; vt100 on --serial)\n"
"  --serial DEVICE                  play on a terminal on a serial line (/dev/ttyS0, /dev/ttyUSB0…)\n"
"  --baud N                         line speed (default 9600)\n"
"  --serial-format 8N1|7E1|…        data bits, parity, stop bits (default 8N1)\n"
"  --flow xon|rts|none              flow control (default xon: XON/XOFF)\n"
"  --size COLSxROWS                 screen size if the terminal can't report it (default: terminfo)\n"
"\n"
"setup:\n"
"  --install                        copy this program to a folder on your PATH (~/.local/bin…)\n"
"  --upgrade                        fetch, build (git + cargo) and install the latest version\n"
"  --uninstall                      remove the installed copy\n"
"  --reset-data                     forget settings and the game library; saves are kept\n"
"  --manual                         the full manual (also: man emuera-tty once installed)"
msgstr ""

